cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NHL-DLBCL: Leakage-Safe Prognostic Modelling in Diffuse Large B-Cell Lymphoma"
abstract: >-
  Code, protocols and results for a pre-registered study of whether H&E nuclear
  morphology adds prognostic value beyond clinical factors in DLBCL, and for an
  audit of hidden sample overlap between public DLBCL gene-expression cohorts.
authors:
